# Idle on USB with the Today board (DECISIONS.md D38): nothing touched for 15 minutes, the sleep screen comes with the
# date, the weather and the agenda, and the device stays on ("Tap to start"). A tap on a part of it opens that app
# there: an agenda row the Agenda on that day, the weather the Weather app's blocks, a count its app; elsewhere the
# launcher. Agenda and weather as in today-board.script (ha-agenda.example.test); today is Thursday 15 January 2026.
wait 1700               # the launcher's relay read: the agenda and the badges
tap 438 628             # Weather: the first place is read and saved
wait 1500
back
wait 902000             # 15 minutes without a touch
shot idle-board
tap 270 566             # Friday's "School run": the Agenda's day view on Friday
wait 1500
shot idle-board-agenda
expect-state view=day|date=2026-01-16
back
wait 902000
tap 270 250             # the weather: its blocks (the second page), the first place
wait 1500
shot idle-board-weather
expect-state page=2|place=Thuis
back
wait 902000
tap 50 800              # the WhatsApp count: its list
wait 1500
expect-state rows=
back
wait 902000
tap 270 700             # an empty part: the launcher
wait 1500
shot idle-board-launcher
